WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.230
Protected customer link redirects to sign in.

2
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.950
Create Taylor Flagship and the insured property through the UI.

3
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.250
Create a $100 Risk Secure quote, then bind it.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:23.320
The policy is bound. A $12.50 commission has accrued.

5
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:29.240
Record a $10 deposit. Finance, commission, and audit history agree.

6
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:34.800
Log out. Reopening the protected policy returns to sign in.
